      {
        "title": "Missing Edge Cases",
        "content": "- Concurrent getCsrfToken calls (promise caching)\n- Fetch failures\n- Response with `ok: false`\n- Missing token/runtime_id in response\n- Cookie format validation\n\n",
        "level": 3
